  "description": "Greets each viewer the first time they chat in a stream with an on-stream bubble showing their picture, name and platform, and welcomes back viewers from earlier streams.",
  "changelog": "4.1.79: aligned with THSV StreamBridge 4.1.79, guided wizard UI, verified update metadata, and regenerated Streamer.bot imports. 4.0.64: new Chatter Greeting extension with first-chat bubbles, welcome-back lines and a greeting overlay.",
